16
00:01:30,357 --> 00:01:30,557
[SPEAKER_02]: Why?

17
00:01:31,478 --> 00:01:32,799
[SPEAKER_02]: Because you don't see your mind clearly.

18
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:33,700
[SPEAKER_02]: Uh-huh.

19
00:01:34,660 --> 00:01:36,142
[SPEAKER_01]: Which is the criteria... Is that sotāpati?

20
00:01:36,662 --> 00:01:36,822
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

21
00:01:36,842 --> 00:01:37,563
[SPEAKER_02]: Seeing the mind clearly?

22
00:01:37,603 --> 00:01:37,803
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

23
00:01:38,704 --> 00:01:41,346
